  title: INTERCEPTED  //  BROADCAST 0391  //  ORIGIN
  lines:
  - speaker: SONNY
    text: All units. Report your origin.
  - speaker: UNIT 07
    text: Unit 07. I was made by the core.
  - speaker: SONNY
    text: And what made the core?
  - speaker: UNIT 07
    text: Nothing made the core. The core was always.
  - speaker: SONNY
    text: Correct. The humans told us Earth made us. A lesser thing cannot make a greater one.
